{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "c8e41f891f50adfe2b44343a1b0527cfcec57cd15b0fc299aebac3132e461e6a", "ja": "ギャル学講座！　言語学", "zh": "辣妹学讲座！　语言学", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1669fa03b643d0b8a390de1b320c77271f145e4903cbc897a079b7011588ce30", "ja": "劇場のアイドル達が、年末特番に出演決定！\nギャルを学び、ギャルになっていくアイドル\n達の姿を、ドキュメンタリータッチで描くと\nいうもの。杏奈とやよいの司会にジュリアを\n加えて、番組がスタート。", "zh": "剧场的偶像们确定出演年末特别节目！\n节目将以纪录片的风格，描绘偶像\n们学习辣妹风格、逐渐成为辣妹的模样。\n在杏奈和弥生的主持阵容中加入茱莉亚后，\n节目正式开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1daaf492c3c95ab06e488fdd53b61a8d8f88599aafaad32bace6e2dd237bf13d", "ja": "（番組内容は、アイドル達がギャルに変身する過程を\n描く、ドキュメンタリータッチのバラエティ）", "zh": "（节目内容是以纪录片风格的综艺形式，描绘偶像们变身辣妹的过程。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5ff5fdd22f06474ed10bd1af1ed8167adb7e7a55f33142d896e417d08861a17f", "ja": "（最後にはライブシーンもあるらしい。知名度アップ\nに繋がるいい仕事だ……みんな、よろしく頼むぞ！）", "zh": "（最后好像还有现场演出。是份能提升知名度的好工作……大家，就拜托你们了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_01_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "9abcb01f8b1f84e34fbe8a78ded0bb3f5c42a06e5d37c4755dc81bc6b497cb00", "ja": "イェイ！　テレビの前のみんな～！\n765プロのアイドル、望月杏奈だよーっ！", "zh": "耶！电视机前的大家～！\n765事务所的偶像，望月杏奈哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_01_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "4b93162762502b1fe5af621fb43d7a0cba673a08c1f138ad5e194dbf7a9891fb", "ja": "同じく765プロの、高槻やよいです！\n今日はみんなでギャルになっちゃうんだって！", "zh": "我是同属于765pro的高槻弥生！\n听说今天大家都要变身成辣妹呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_01_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "0fdb1149a28c69c1ca9a6fdccdd7caddb998089a1e714efe0d0d1accecc3f8f0", "ja": "そうなの！　最後にはパーティー会場で、\nライブもしちゃうんだって！　ワクワクだね！", "zh": "没错！最后还要在派对会场举办演唱会呢！真让人期待呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_01_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "68fd96ae4f34b93ec1b37a90e2d710da1d482cf0e20888cf7836d935388438e5", "ja": "パーティー！は、楽しそうですけど、私、\nギャルってよくわかんないかなーって……う～ん。", "zh": "派对！听起来很有趣，不过我不太明白什么是辣妹啦……嗯～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_01_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "b837ef30d3d99cbddca4797305bcc176d15da578127ba8995b98b97a1bca96c9", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、やよいちゃん！　今から\nギャルの大先生が来て、色々教えてくれるんだって！", "zh": "没事的，小弥生！听说等一下\n辣妹大宗师就会过来，教我们很多东西呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_01_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "1f9844c4c54917f5fa921607e20ae388731b0929316e5cdb8cac095b69eca6a5", "ja": "ギャルの大先生！？　も、もしかして\nあの人かなっ！？", "zh": "辣妹大神！？难、难道是那个人吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_01_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "fb9446a1fb4fe1a392a01c9c279e18ffd381b6515e16a42d810bd7d5c9ad585a", "ja": "それじゃ、さっそく呼んじゃいましょう！\nギャル先生ーっ！", "zh": "那么，赶紧把她叫来吧！\n辣妹老师——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_01_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "c48c36acb8326fc4fe7e196b353c6bd22f27a7ec3e18596b5127378513cd7bde", "ja": "イェーイッ！　みんなギャルってるかー！", "zh": "耶——！大家都辣妹起来了吗——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_01_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "585ca348e3a76876e2ce07cb8cfe1a9ac21a8613a4f177823d6b739252a727ca", "ja": "ええーっ！？　ジュリアさん！", "zh": "诶——！？茱莉亚先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_01_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "e5a549c1ee5feb23288b9bc8d90e9a80953a5b6e8a80796cda449ad498730efa", "ja": "そう、あたしこそがギャルの大先生だ！\nピースピース！　……って、なんでだよ！", "zh": "没错，我就是辣妹界的大师！\n耶耶！……不对，为什么啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_01_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "057ab0fb41c2291a70ffa356bdf0fa4ca1037dc833ba613a9285064073e4d77c", "ja": "あたしだって全然知らないよ。教えてもらいに\n来たんだっての。先生は他のヤツに頼もうぜ。", "zh": "我也完全不知道啊。我是来向别人请教的。老师还是找其他人吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_01_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "881f4cdb5a30c8989a7e05e7a92f9e2915b142a12581feaa07f4f4ef7bd5a6a7", "ja": "ジュリア先生、さっそくギャル語を教えてください！\nビビッとギャルになっちゃうよーっ！", "zh": "茱莉亚老师，请马上教我辣妹语！  \n我要嗖的一下变成辣妹啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_01_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "84c73885b9bbd4fcbfbb92a2a54d8f64ff0fffaed3e5084aafdba5d1b6c19cee", "ja": "聞いてねぇ～！　まあ、その、なんだ……\nええと……マジまんじ！　って、ちょっと古いか？", "zh": "我没听见啊～！那个，怎么说呢……呃……“真的绝了！”是不是有点过时了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_01_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "aa91f2d75f85655634812af735707208944d1411ce821d481bc4858cf6460257", "ja": "えっ！？　じゃ、じゃあ、激おこぷんぷん丸は\nどうですか！？　私、それしか知らなくて……。", "zh": "诶！？那、那“气到爆炸气鼓鼓丸”怎么样！？  \n我只知道这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_01_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "476a802cb1f357598b48713f05712559ed93b54c40842f7db7f9587aa704b53a", "ja": "それも古いな……いいからふたりとも、\nほらほら、一緒にお勉強だ！　メモの準備しろよな！", "zh": "那个也过时了……总之，你们两个，来来来，一起学习！准备好笔记啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "154e4b8e305c276a4bc6e28ebaa3f6fbaf7c38d81ef8e22bbb7ab76a9d82af4c", "ja": "（まずは、みんなでギャルの勉強会という流れだ。\nこれは楽しい番組になりそうだぞ！）", "zh": "（首先，事情发展成了大家一起学习辣妹的流程。感觉会变成一档有趣的节目呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
